            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class='section process-section' id='process'>
          <div class='shell process-layout'>
            <div class='process-copy' data-reveal>
              <p class='kicker'>A calmer process</p>
              <h2>From “we’ve been hacked” to a clear way forward.</h2>
              <p>
                Security work can feel opaque. My process keeps the technical
