              </p>
              <a class='text-link' href='/about/'
                >How I work <ArrowRight size={17} /></a
              >
            </div>

            <ol class='process-steps stagger-reveal' data-reveal>
              <li>
                <span>01</span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Share the symptoms</strong><p>
                    Send the URL and tell me what you noticed.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>02</span>
                <div>
                  <strong>I investigate</strong><p>
                    Files, database, users, cron jobs, and access points.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>03</span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Cleanup & recovery</strong><p>
                    Malware is removed and legitimate content is preserved.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>04</span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Secure the next chapter</strong><p>
                    I harden the site and explain the important findings.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class='quote-section'>
          <div class='shell quote-card' data-reveal>
            <div class='quote-mark'>“</div>
            <div class='quote-stars' aria-label='5 out of 5 stars'>
              {
                Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
                  <Star size={16} fill='currentColor' />
                ))
              }
            </div>
            <blockquote>
              I highly recommend MD Pabel for help with resolving malware issues
              on your website. From start to finish, this was an excellent
              customer support experience. A+++
            </blockquote>
            <footer>
              <span class='quote-avatar'>JS</span>
              <p>
                <strong>
                  <a
                    href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/saysjill/'
                    target='_blank'
                    rel='noopener noreferrer'>Jill Sawyer</a
                  >
                </strong><span
                  >United States client · LinkedIn recommendation</span
                >
              </p>
            </footer>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class='section insights-section' id='insights'>
          <div class='shell'>
            <div class='section-heading insights-heading' data-reveal>
              <div>
                <p class='kicker'>Security notes</p>
                <h2>Useful answers, without the fear tactics.</h2>
              </div>
              <a class='text-link' href='/blog/'
                >Browse the blog <ArrowRight size={17} /></a
              >
            </div>

            <div class='insight-grid stagger-reveal' data-reveal>
              {
                insights.map((item, index) => (
                  <a href={item.href} class='insight-card'>
                    <span class='insight-number'>
                      {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
                    </span>
                    <span class='insight-category'>{item.category}</span>
                    <h3>{item.title}</h3>
                    <span class='read-link'>
                      Read article <ArrowUpRight size={16} />
                    </span>
